<title>USA: Ultimate Jan same-store sales down 10 pct.</title>
<headline>Ultimate Jan same-store sales down 10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ultimate Electronics Inc said Monday that its January same-store sales fell 10 percent.</p>
<p>The company said its total sales for January were $21.6 million, a two percent increase from sales of $21.3 million in January of 1995.</p>
</text>
